    "final_answer": "I have successfully found a suitable chocolate cupcake recipe on Allrecipes that meets all the criteria.\n\n## Recipe Found: Easy Moist Chocolate Cupcakes\n\n**Source:** https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/17377/chocolate-cupcakes/\n\n### Recipe Details:\n- **Recipe Name:** Easy Moist Chocolate Cupcakes\n- **Prep Time:** 15 mins\n- **Cook Time:** 15 mins\n- **Total Time:** 30 mins ✅ (well under 1 hour)\n- **Servings/Yield:** 16 cupcakes\n- **User Reviews:** 957 Reviews ✅ (well over 100)\n- **Ratings:** 1,219 Ratings\n- **Rating:** 4.7 out of 5 stars\n- **Submitted by:** Ladan M Miller\n- **Updated:** January 21, 2026\n\n### Description:\nThis chocolate cupcake recipe makes rich, moist, and tender cupcakes from scratch with cocoa powder and easy baking ingredients. It's perfect for frosting with chocolate buttercream for the ultimate chocolaty treat, ideal for birthdays and holiday parties.\n\nThis recipe satisfies both requirements:\n1. ✅ **Preparation time under 1 hour:** Total time is just 30 minutes (15 mins prep + 15 mins cook)\n2. ✅ **At least 100 user reviews:** Has 957 user reviews with a 4.7/5 rating",
